      <note>DFT-load_cdm_source_to_concept_map
Reviewed lab unit rules (data/reference/unit_rule.csv) -&gt; cdm.source_to_concept_map, the OMOP table for
mappings of local codes. Only tier 1 (already UCUM) and tier 2 (same unit, other notation) are mapped,
tier 3 stays at concept 0. Read by DFT-load_map_code_map. Refused rows go to adm.map_load_reject.</note>
